  "stac_version": "1.0.0",
  "title": "Greenland Ice Sheet Surface Velocity 2024",
  "description": "Comprehensive ice velocity mapping of the Greenland ice sheet derived from multi-sensor radar observations collected throughout 2024. High-resolution surface flow velocities are generated by synergizing Sentinel-1 C-band Synthetic Aperture Radar speckle tracking with CryoSat-2 SIRAL radar altimetry measurements. This dataset provides critical boundary conditions for assessing ice dynamics, discharge rates, and ice-sheet mass balance changes.",
